Item 700 750 800 850 series check Weapons and Shields
    Events
        Unit - A unit Acquires an item
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Hero manipulating item)) Not equal to Bag
        (Unit-type of (Hero manipulating item)) Not equal to Stash
    Actions
        -------- 700 1H Weapon --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Item level of (Item being manipulated)) Greater than or equal to 700
                (Item level of (Item being manipulated)) Less than or equal to 749
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet IDS_Level = (Item level of (Item being manipulated))
                Set VariableSet IDS_Unit = (Triggering unit)
                Set VariableSet IDS_Size = (Size of inventory for IDS_Unit)
                -------- -------- Setting value of Item from random to 0 -------- --------
                Set VariableSet IDS_Item = 0
                -------- Check that no other weapon is in inventory --------
                For each (Integer IDS_LoopInteger) from 1 to IDS_Size, do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Item level of (Item carried by IDS_Unit in slot IDS_LoopInteger)) Greater than or equal to 700
                                (Item level of (Item carried by IDS_Unit in slot IDS_LoopInteger)) Less than or equal to 849
                            Then - Actions
                                Set VariableSet IDS_Item = (IDS_Item + 1)
                                -------- -------- It will increase to 1 if hero have 1 item level 1, to 2 if hero have 2 items level 1... -------- --------
                            Else - Actions
                -------- How many items of item Level allowed --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        IDS_Item Greater than 1
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet tmp_point = (Position of (Triggering unit))
                        -------- -------- Move the item, and the hero will lose it. -------- --------
                        Item - Move (Item being manipulated) to tmp_point
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                EasyItem_SystemActive Equal to False
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- -------- Warn player -------- --------
                                Custom script:   call DisplayTextToPlayer(GetOwningPlayer(GetTriggerUnit()), 0, 0, "|cffffcc00WARNING:|r You cannot carry more than one weapon.")
                                -------- ================ --------
                                -------- CHAT --------
                                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                                    If - Conditions
                                        (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
                                    Then - Actions
                                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Nazgrek named Nazgrek: Play Nazgrek_ItemErrorWeapons <gen> and display I can’t wield two....  Modify duration: Set to 2.00 seconds and Don't wait
                                    Else - Actions
                                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                                    If - Conditions
                                        (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
                                    Then - Actions
                                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Zulkis named Zul'kis: Play Zulkis_ItemErrorWeapons <gen> and display I can’t wield two....  Modify duration: Set to 1.75 seconds and Don't wait
                                    Else - Actions
                                -------- ================ --------
                            Else - Actions
                        -------- -------- Get rid of leaks -------- --------
                        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_tmp_point)
                    Else - Actions
                Set VariableSet IDS_Unit = No unit
            Else - Actions
